OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms
OL,13,     Fincluding Elgar's 1st Symphony
OL,14,     Ffrom the BBC Scottish Symphony;
OL,15,     Fplus chamber highlights from the
OL,16,     Frecent Aldeburgh Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,18,     F5/5. Donald Macleod dives into
OL,19,     FSmith's final years and explores
OL,20,     Fher last orchestral works, with
OL,21,     Fguests Ian Graham-Jones and Leanne
OL,22,     FLangley.
